  "description": "Plus Size Fashion Figure | 10 Poses\nCreate professional plus size fashion sketches with this collection of 10 plus size fashion figure poses for Procreate.\nDesigned for fashion designers, fashion students, illustrators, apparel brands, and creative professionals, this brush set features realistic curvy female fashion figures with balanced proportions and natural body shapes.\nThe Plus Size Collection is perfect for inclusive fashion design, curvy womenswear development, size-inclusive collections, fashion illustration, portfolio projects, technical design preparation, and client presentations.\nThese poses help designers accurately visualize garments on plus size body types while maintaining professional fashion proportions and realistic weight distribution.\nSimply stamp a pose onto your canvas, lower the opacity, create a new layer, and begin designing immediately.\nWHAT’S INCLUDED\n• 10 Plus Size Fashion Figure Poses\n• Procreate Brush Set (.brushset)\n• High-Quality Fashion Figure Bases\n• Installation Guide\n• Preview Images\nPERFECT FOR\n• Fashion Designers\n• Fashion Students\n• Fashion Illustrators\n• Plus Size Fashion Brands\n• Apparel Brands\n• Procreate Users\n• Digital Artists\nUSE FOR\n• Plus Size Fashion Design\n• Curvy Womenswear Development\n• Inclusive Fashion Collections\n• Fashion Illustration\n• Collection Planning\n• Portfolio Development\n• Client Presentations\n• Digital Fashion Design\nFEATURES\n• 10 Plus Size Fashion Figure Poses\n• Realistic Curvy Body Shapes\n• Professional Fashion Proportions\n• Easy Stamp Workflow\n• Time-Saving Design Resource\n• Optimized for Procreate\n• Perfect for Beginners and Professionals\nCOMPATIBILITY\nCompatible with Procreate for iPad.\nPlease ensure that Procreate is installed before purchasing.\nPLEASE NOTE\nThis is a digital download product. No physical item will be shipped.\nABOUT HYDNSTUDIO\nHYDNSTUDIO creates professional fashion design resources for designers, students, apparel brands, and creative studios worldwide.",
