re purchasing.</p>\n<p>PLEASE NOTE</p>\n<p>This is a digital download product. No physical item will be shipped.</p>\n<p>ABOUT HYDNSTUDIO</p>\n<p>HYDNSTUDIO creates professional fashion design resources for designers, students, apparel brands, and creative studios worldwide.</p>",
